em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jòng ma-ài-jiàu-khî-kâng lai-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">三分<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">살ˉ훈ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">天<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">注定<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">주`댤ˉ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        sā̰-hûn thḭ̂ jù-tiā̰\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">七分<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">칟ˆ훈ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">靠<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">코`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">拍拚<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        chît-hûn khò-phâh-pia̰\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">애<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">拚<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뱔</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">才<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">贏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">얄ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ài-pia̰ jiâh-e-yá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n"
